        </mxCell>

        <mxCell id="TAKE" value="&lt;b&gt;Measured result:&lt;/b&gt; the same eviction design (avg 1,024 tokens/layer) is nearly harmless on Llama (−1/60 scenarios) yet collapses Qwen retrieval (48/60 &#8594; 1/60): a shared KV head is a single point of failure for every query head that uses it." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffe6cc;strokeColor=#d79b00;fontColor=#7c4a00;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="640" y="420" width="800" height="70" as="geometry"/>
